        "text": "{\"recorded_count\": 15, \"total_count\": 15, \"missing_ids\": [], \"complete\": true, \"results\": [{\"item_id\": \"FT-1\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"List cards show name, cuisine · price band, rating, neighborhood, features (e.g. \\\"The Golden Fork | French · $$$$ | 4.8 | Downtown | Private Dining | Wine Pairing\\\"). Detail /restaurant/1 shows name, cuisine, rating+review count, address, price band $$$$, full description and features (Private Dining, Wine Pairing, Tasting Menu). Price per diner is expressed as a $-band (legend \\\"$$$$ - Fine Dining\\\"), no numeric average.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-2\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Search \\\"Waterfront\\\"(neighborhood)→Ocean Blue only; \\\"Indian\\\"(cuisine)→Spice Route only; \\\"Golden\\\"(name)→The Golden Fork only. Combination search \\\"a\\\"+price $$ → 3 matching results (Trattoria Bella, Ember & Smoke, Spice Route); adding cuisine Italian → 1 result (Trattoria Bella). Count label matched results each time.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-3\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"On /restaurant/1 selected Sep 1 2026, 19:00, 2 Guests, entered name/email/phone and submitted → inline \\\"Reservation Confirmed!\\\" panel; My Reservations shows Upcoming (1): The Golden Fork, September 1, 2026, 19:00, 2 Guests, Downtown, Coupon applied: WELCOME10.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-4\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Cancelled the Trattoria Bella reservation via Cancel → \\\"Cancel Reservation?\\\" dialog → \\\"Cancel Reservation\\\". Upcoming went 2→1 and no longer lists it; Past (1) shows Trattoria Bella, September 5 2026, 19:30, 2 Guests, Little Italy, status \\\"Cancelled\\\", coupon retained.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-5\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"On /restaurant/1 submitted 5-star review (QA Tester, 2026-08-20, comment). Review list grew to \\\"Reviews (3)\\\" with entry [\\\"QA Tester\\\",\\\"Visited Aug 20, 2026\\\",\\\"rating-5-of-5\\\", comment]; restaurant 2 review list still shows only Emily K., so review is scoped to restaurant 1.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-6\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Coupon WEEKEND20 applied showing \\\"- 20% off\\\"; remove button cleared it back to code input; WELCOME10 applied showing \\\"- 10% off\\\" and the created reservation displays \\\"Coupon applied: WELCOME10\\\".\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Date picker (today = Aug 28 2026): all days up to and including Aug 28 rendered disabled; Aug 29 onward selectable. Selected Sep 1 2026 and combined it with one of the restaurant's listed times (19:00 from 17:00-21:00 list), which produced a confirmed reservation.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Reservation date cannot be modified\", \"actual\": \"The Modify Reservation dialog contains only \\\"New Time\\\" and \\\"Party Size\\\" controls (dialog text: \\\"Modify Reservation / New Time 19:00 / Party Size 2 Guests / Save Changes / Close\\\") — there is no date field. Time 19:00→20:30 and party size 2→5 saved and displayed correctly, but the date (September 1, 2026) cannot be changed at all.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Review submission is not gated by a completed reservation\", \"actual\": \"With zero reservations (My Reservations showed \\\"Upcoming (0)\\\" / \\\"Past (0)\\\" and empty state), the \\\"Write a Review\\\" form on /restaurant/1 was fully available and a 5-star review was accepted and published (Reviews count 2→3). No eligibility check or per-reservation one-review limit is enforced anywhere.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Day-of-week and first-reservation eligibility rules are not enforced\", \"actual\": \"WEEKEND20 (\\\"20% off weekend dining\\\") was accepted for Tuesday Sep 1, 2026 (- 20% off). WELCOME10 (\\\"10% off your first reservation\\\") was accepted again on a second reservation after one had already been booked (- 10% off). Only the party-size rule works (GROUP15 with 2 guests → \\\"This coupon requires a party of 6 or more.\\\"), and one-coupon-at-a-time is enforced structurally (apply control replaced by applied coupon + remove). Unknown codes are silently ignored with no feedback.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Missing date/time blocks submission silently with no message identifying the problem\", \"actual\": \"Name/email/phone are enforced by native HTML5 validation with visible messages (e.g. \\\"Please fill out this field.\\\", invalid email \\\"not-an-email\\\" → \\\"Please include an '@'...\\\"). However, with all contact fields valid but Date and Time left unset, clicking \\\"Confirm Reservation\\\" does nothing: no toast, no inline error text, no aria-invalid / error styling on the Date or Time controls, and no reservation created. The user is given no indication of what is missing.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Modify opens a \\\"Modify Reservation\\\" dialog offering New Time and Party Size; Save Changes closed the dialog and persisted 20:30 / 5 Guests. Cancel opens a \\\"Cancel Reservation?\\\" confirmation: choosing \\\"Keep Reservation\\\" left Upcoming (2) unchanged; only after \\\"Cancel Reservation\\\" was the booking cancelled.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Create: form replaced in place by \\\"Reservation Confirmed! Check your email for confirmation details.\\\" and the booking appeared under Upcoming without reload. Modify: dialog closed and the card immediately showed 20:30 / 5 Guests. Cancel: card moved from Upcoming (2→1) to Past (0→1) with status Cancelled instantly, all within the same session with no manual reload (no toast is shown for modify/cancel, but the views update visibly and immediately).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Separate \\\"Upcoming (1)\\\" and \\\"Past (1)\\\" tabs. Upcoming card: The Golden Fork, French · $$$$, status \\\"Upcoming\\\", September 1 2026, 20:30, 5 Guests, Downtown, \\\"Coupon applied: WELCOME10\\\". Past card: Trattoria Bella, Italian · $$, status \\\"Cancelled\\\", September 5 2026, 19:30, 2 Guests, Little Italy, \\\"Coupon applied: WELCOME10\\\".\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Rating inconsistent between list and detail; list summary not updated by new review; review count absent from list\", \"actual\": \"Home list shows The Golden Fork 4.8 while /restaurant/1 shows 4.5 (2 reviews) before the review — already inconsistent. After submitting a 5-star review the detail updated to 4.7 (3) but the home list still shows 4.8. Sakura Garden: list 4.6 vs detail 5.0 (1). List cards display no review count at all.\", \"evidence\": null}]}"
